    "summary": "Archive record recovered from the source cosmology.",
    "markdown": "## Classification\n- **Class**: Shadow Entities\n- **Tier**: Varies\n\n## Physical Description\n- **Form**: Humanoid silhouettes, dark figures\n- **Material**: Shadow, smoke, darkness\n- **Features**: Often indistinct, vague\n- **Eyes**: Sometimes glowing, red or white\n- **Movement**: Jerky, unnatural, teleporting\n\n## Function\n- **Primary**: Manifestations of fear, paranoia\n- **Secondary**: Testers of courage\n- **Tertiary**: Revealers of shadow aspects\n\n## Affect Profile\n- **Primary**: Terrifying, threatening\n- **Secondary**: Mysterious, watching\n- **Tertiary**: Sometimes neutral, observing\n\n## Types\n- **The Watchers**: Stand and observe\n- **The Approachers**: Move closer, threatening\n- **The Hiders**: Lurk in corners, periphery\n- **The Mimics**: Copy movements, mock\n\n## Associated Phenomena\n- **Paranoia**: Feeling of being watched, followed\n- **Delusions**: False beliefs about their nature\n- **Fear response**: Intense terror, panic\n- **Shadow work**: Confronting dark aspects of psyche\n\n## Coping Strategies\n- **Acknowledge**: Don't fight, observe\n- **Breathe**: Stay calm, breathe through fear\n- **Remember**: They cannot truly harm\n- **Integrate**: Learn from the encounter\n\n## Cosmological Position\n- **Layer**: The Shadow Realm\n- **Function**: Shadow manifestation, fear testing\n- **Parallel**: Shadow archetype, trickster",
