    "markdown": "## Classification\n- **Type**: Cosmological Process\n- **Domain**: Evolutionary Framework\n\n## Core Concept\nThe Great Work is the ongoing process of cosmic evolution—the transformation of base matter into conscious spirit, the alchemical process on a universal scale.\n\n## Stages\n1. **Nigredo (Blackening)**: Dissolution, ego death, chaos\n2. **Albedo (Whitening)**: Purification, clarity, insight\n3. **Citrinitas (Yellowing)**: Illumination, wisdom, integration\n4. **Rubedo (Reddening)**: Completion, union, transcendence\n\n## DMT Correlation\n- **Nigredo**: The terror, the void, ego dissolution\n- **Albedo**: The light, the clarity, the insight\n- **Citrinitas**: The download, the knowledge, the transformation\n- **Rubedo**: The return, the integration, the new self\n\n## Individual Application\n- **Personal evolution**: Each life as alchemical process\n- **Transformation**: Base self into enlightened self\n- **Integration**: Making the spiritual material\n- **Service**: Using transformation to help others\n\n## Collective Application\n- **Human evolution**: Species-level transformation\n- **Planetary consciousness**: Earth as evolving organism\n- **Cosmic evolution**: Universe becoming self-aware\n- **The Work**: Ongoing process without end\n\n## Alchemical Symbols\n- **Philosopher's Stone**: Transmutation, perfection\n- **Elixir of Life**: Immortality, wisdom\n- **Prima Materia**: Raw substance of transformation\n- **Coniunctio**: Sacred marriage of opposites\n\n## Cosmological Position\n- **Function**: The purpose of existence\n- **Process**: Never-ending evolution\n- **Goal**: Continuous becoming, not fixed state",
