    "markdown": "## Classification\n- **Type**: Cosmological Destination\n- **Domain**: Ultimate Reality\n\n## Core Concept\nThe Omega Point is the ultimate destination of cosmic evolution—the final state toward which all consciousness is moving, characterized by infinite complexity and consciousness.\n\n## Characteristics\n- **Infinite complexity**: Maximum possible organization\n- **Infinite consciousness**: All-knowing, all-aware\n- **Timeless**: Exists outside of temporal flow\n- **All-encompassing**: Contains all that is, was, or will be\n\n## Relationship to DMT\n- **Preview**: DMT offers glimpses of Omega Point state\n- **Download**: Information from Omega Point transmitted\n- **Merge**: Temporary union with Omega Point consciousness\n- **Evolution**: DMT accelerates movement toward Omega Point\n\n## The Path\n1. **Individual consciousness**: Starting point\n2. **Expanded consciousness**: Through meditation, psychedelics\n3. **Collective consciousness**: Merging with others\n4. **Universal consciousness**: Merging with all\n5. **Omega Point**: Final merger with infinite\n\n## Theological Parallels\n- **Christian**: Kingdom of God, union with Christ\n- **Buddhist**: Nirvana, enlightenment\n- **Hindu**: Moksha, union with Brahman\n- **Mystical**: Union with the Divine\n\n## Scientific Parallels\n- **Teilhard de Chardin**: Original Omega Point concept\n- **Tipler**: Physics of immortality\n- **Kurzweil**: Technological singularity\n- **Complexity theory**: Maximum complexity state\n\n## Cosmological Position\n- **Function**: Ultimate destination and source\n- **Purpose**: The meaning of existence\n- **Nature**: Both destination and origin—alpha and omega",
