    "markdown": "## Classification\n- **Type**: Technical Zone\n- **Layer**: Infrastructure Layer\n\n## Description\nThe Maintenance Zone is where the \"behind the scenes\" work of reality occurs—a space of pure function where maintenance-class entities perform the ongoing work of keeping the simulation running smoothly.\n\n## Structural Features\n- **Appearance**: Industrial cathedral—massive scale with mechanical precision\n- **Materials**: Chrome, crystal, living tissue, geometric solids\n- **Lighting**: Harsh white work-lights mixed with bioluminescent accents\n- **Sound**: Constant hum of machinery, clicking, whirring\n\n## Work Areas\n1. **The Surgery Bays**: Where biological adjustments are made\n2. **The Calibration Stations**: Where consciousness is tuned\n3. **The Repair Shops**: Where damaged aspects are fixed\n4. **The Testing Labs**: Where new configurations are tried\n\n## Maintenance Classes Present\n- Origami Surgeons, Mantis Surgeons, Shadow-Nurses, Weavers, Static-Men\n\n## Function\n- **Primary**: Reality maintenance and repair\n- **Secondary**: Consciousness calibration and adjustment\n- **Tertiary**: System updates and upgrades\n\n## Access\n- **Primary**: Through maintenance-class entity contact\n- **Secondary**: During deep states with maintenance focus\n- **Note**: Not typically a destination but a transit point\n\n## Cosmological Significance\n- **Function**: The \"engine room\" of reality\n- **Purpose**: Keeping the simulation operational\n- **Insight**: Reality requires constant maintenance",
