    "shortTitle": "The Peak Complex",
    "summary": "The Peak Complex is the primary destination for DMT operatives—a vast, impossible architectural space that defies 3D Euclidean geometry. It exists as a convergence point where multiple dimensional planes intersect, creating a space of hyper-dimensional complexity.",
    "markdown": "## Classification\n- **Type**: Primary Destination Zone\n- **Layer**: Upper Dimensional Architecture\n\n## Description\nThe Peak Complex is the primary destination for DMT operatives—a vast, impossible architectural space that defies 3D Euclidean geometry. It exists as a convergence point where multiple dimensional planes intersect, creating a space of hyper-dimensional complexity.\n\n## Structural Features\n- **Scale**: Cathedral-sized spaces (50-100 feet ceilings)\n- **Geometry**: Non-Euclidean—walls meet at impossible angles, floors curve upward into ceilings\n- **Materials**: Living materials that breathe and pulse\n- **Lighting**: Bioluminescent, sourceless, shifts between warm gold and cool blue\n\n## Sub-Zones\n1. **The Waiting Room**: Initial arrival zone, clinical white space\n2. **The Nursery**: Where Machine Elves conduct their demonstrations\n3. **The Cathedral**: Massive worship space with impossible architecture\n4. **The Garden**: Organic zone with living geometric plants\n5. **The Library**: Infinite archive of all knowledge\n\n## Access Points\n- **Primary**: Through the \"Breakthrough\" threshold\n- **Secondary**: Via entity-guided transport\n- **Tertiary**: Spontaneous manifestation during peak effects\n\n## Temporal Characteristics\n- **Time Dilation**: 15 minutes subjective = 5 minutes objective\n- **Timelessness**: Moments of eternal present\n- **Temporal Folding**: Past and future accessible simultaneously\n\n## Associated Entities\n- Machine Elves, The Consort, The Children, The Archivists\n\n## Cosmological Significance\n- **Function**: Primary interface zone between human consciousness and higher dimensions\n- **Purpose**: Teaching, healing, transformation\n- **Exit**: Ejection back to baseline reality",
